  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\lambda_{m}^{-}=\\lambda_{m}^{-}$ (oxalate) $+\\lambda_{m}^{-}\\left(\\mathrm{Na}^{+}\\right)+\\lambda_{m}^{-}\\left(\\mathrm{K}^{+}\\right)$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n=(148 \\cdot 2+73 \\cdot 5+50 \\cdot 1) \\\\\r\n=271.85 \\mathrm{cm}^{2} \\mathrm{mol}^{-1}\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\r\n$\\therefore$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\lambda_{e q}^{-} &=\\frac{\\lambda_{m}^{-}}{n \\cdot \\text { factor }}=\\frac{271.8}{2} \\\\\r\n&=135.9 \\mathrm{Scm}^{2} \\mathrm{eq}^{-1}\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$",
